  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Supply and Sanitation Project in Cyclone Prone Coastal Areas of Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing supply of safe water and sanitation in cyclone prone coastal areas and partially to support long-term cyclone readiness facility for water supply and sanitation. It will help reducing water related diseases and post cyclone environmental hazards.</narrative>
